WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.160
The evaluation corpus
has its own lifecycle.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:05.440
Curate permitted examples
and reviewed failures,

00:00:05.497 --> 00:00:08.640
remove near duplicates,
and label expected behavior.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.080
Keep development cases separate from
held-out evaluation and adversarial sets.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.120
Related cases should stay
in the same split so duplicated

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:20.640
information does not inflate
confidence. Version the source,

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:24.400
expectation, scenario
tag and review decision.

00:00:24.549 --> 00:00:29.280
Report important slices rather than
relying only on an overall result.
